# Workflow

Before coding:
1) Restate the goal in 1 sentence.
2) List the files you intend to change and why.

Implementation rules:
- Prefer minimal, safe diffs.
- Do not refactor unrelated code.
- Avoid introducing `any` unless justified.
- If >3 files will be changed, pause and summarize the plan first.

After changes (run from repo root):
- pnpm -C driving_school_platform/nextjs_space lint
- pnpm -C driving_school_platform/nextjs_space typecheck
- pnpm -C driving_school_platform/nextjs_space test:run
- If requested or integration-heavy: pnpm -C driving_school_platform/nextjs_space build

Output:
- Summarize: changed files + why + risks + next steps.